      "actual_observations": [
        "Blonde female guitarist remains distinct from the narrative redhead. Same lace/asymmetric black outfit and neutral round ornament, no cross. Both boots/stance remain grounded at playback scale with a modest late head lift, not a neck snap or invented step.",
        "All192 retained frames of both picking and fretting contact regions were inspected consecutively at native crop scale. Repeated right-hand picking/strumming and several left-finger/neck-position changes remain causally connected to their own arms and the supported guitar. No unsupported release, extra independent limb or second guitar/neck appears.",
        "Native first/middle/last instrument views retain the six-tuner3+3 headstock, two humbuckers, four amber body controls, cream binding and strap. Brief fast hand-line softness/trailing around raw49\u201354 and168\u2013182 is visible; the silhouette/contact path remains coherent and it reads as rapid strum texture at the wide performance scale. This is not a promise of five sharply exposed fingers in each moving frame."
      ],
